<title>ISRAEL: SOCCER-ISRAEL AND GERMANY DRAW 1-1 IN UNDER 21 MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL AND GERMANY DRAW 1-1 IN UNDER 21 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>HERZLIYA, Israel 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's and Germany's</p>
<p>under-21 sides drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in a soccer friendly here</p>
<p>on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Israel - Manor Hassan 2</p>
<p>Germany - Lars Ricken 47 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
</text>
